        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour targets are four individuals with direct knowledge of Marcus Stuyvesant’s illicit activities. They include his daughter, his bodyguard, the helicopter pilot involved in transporting restricted items, and the penthouse chef who has been privy to private conversations inside the suite.\r\rThe client expects a full containment operation. Eliminate all four targets and ensure their knowledge dies with them.",
